{"id":"3771961e9c41f6ee","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-submersion.md","title":"Submersion","display":"df-submersion — Submersion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-submersion","aliases":["58-df-submersion","Submersion"],"display":"df-submersion — Submersion","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-submersion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-submersion</span><span>Submersion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-submersion — Submersion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,M,N,p\\in V\">\\(F,M,N,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Submersion}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Submersion}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N\\land\\forall w\\in T_{F(p)}N\\;\\exists v\\in T_pM\\;(dF_p(v)=w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N\\land\\forall w\\in T_{F(p)}N\\;\\exists v\\in T_pM\\;(dF_p(v)=w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{Submersion}_S(F,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{Submersion}_S(F,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Submersion: derivative is surjective at every point</li>\n<li>At a point, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubmersionAt}(F,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubmersionAt}(F,p)\\)</span> abbreviates the surjectivity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N\">\\(dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Regular value: every preimage point has surjective derivative</li>\n<li>Preimage theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{-1}(q)\">\\(F^{-1}(q)\\)</span> is submanifold if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> regular</li>\n<li>Examples: projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^{n+k} \\to \\mathbb{R}^k\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{n+k} \\to \\mathbb{R}^k\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,M,N,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Submersion}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N\\land\\forall w\\in T_{F(p)}N\\;\\exists v\\in T_pM\\;(dF_p(v)=w)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submersion}\\vdash\\mathrm{Submersion}_S(F,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{SubmersionAt}_S(F,M,N,p)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubmersionAt}(F,p)","display":false},{"tex":"dF_p:T_pM\\to T_{F(p)}N","display":false},{"tex":"F^{-1}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^{n+k} \\to \\mathbb{R}^k","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-submersion.md|58-df-submersion]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d87c5d842ade903d"]}